# Input

```scss
%base{color:red}
.target:not(.x){color:red}
.line{@extend %base // target
}
.block-line{@extend %base /* inside */ // outside
}
.line-block{@extend %base // first
/* inside */ }
.mixed{@extend %base // first
/* inside */ // outside
// last
}
.explicit{@extend %base /* inside */ // outside
;}
.import{@import "theme.css" /* inside */ // outside
}
.unknown{@foo bar // first
/* inside */ // outside
}
.apply{@apply py-3 /* inside */ // outside
// last
}
.own-line{@apply py-3
// outside

// last
}
.pseudo{@extend :not(.x) // target
}
.pseudo-after{@extend :not(.x) // first
; /* second */ }
.after-block{@extend %base // first
; /* second */ }
.after-line{@apply py-3 // first
; // second
}
.suppressed{
/* biome-ignore format: keep statement */
@apply    py-3; // outside
}
.after{width:1px}
@foo bar /* inside */ // outside
```


